{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Let them turn back on account of shame</b> — like <i>at the heels of the flock</i>. And some say: on account of the punishment and recompense of those who shame me, like <i>when they kept [watch] for the heel</i>, like recompense, and instead of rejoicing when they are put to shame, then those who seek You will rejoice and lift [their] voice."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 70, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:44.002909101Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}